 for business while it's dark, and you may notice your customers are a little more frightening.. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple cities, each with their own vibe. From the quiet Lunara to the hustle and bustle of Neo Solara, everywhere you go is a new adventure! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Adventurers Guild and use a variety of magic and weapons to explore dungeons and uncover hidden secrets. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505230/extras/2d886331df0f3c09b43eefd7c1760d70.avif?t=1760287258\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your business by opening a bakery, adding an underground bar, growing your own coffee beans, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple backstories to choose from, with each one providing different benefits and NPC interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14+ NPCs that can be romanced, as well as many more you can befriend! There are also regular customers that you'll get to know throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in karaoke night, visit the aquarium, make it big in the stock market. There's no shortage of things to do!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Vogy Bear"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505230/19780d7af288d677573ae93c947f3425e75b3400/header.jpg?t=1760287258","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2505230/1105970964/d4311847e7f130cf2143ecb4d1ade660adb6a2